From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 23:43:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 21/30] ARM64: Linux aarch64 and native Windows ARM64 builds
 with Zig

- toolchain files zig-linux-aarch64 / zig-windows-aarch64, scripts/capi/build-arm64.sh
- Linux: hide symbols with a version script (works with zig's linker too)
- capi CMake: MinGW-GCC-only link flags; test-capi quick mode for emulators
- run-tests.bat skips LayaTests.exe when absent

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LAsYHSSgSysMFa8MKPJWgL
